    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d496">

                <pb facs="0827" n="780" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg780"/>

                <head>496. Telegram 1526 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d496-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-02-21">February 21, 1956,
                        noon</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d496-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d496-1"/>
                <p>1526. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Following list four names handed me by Wang 37th meeting February 18 (my telegram
                    1513, paragraph 81):</p>
                <p>[<hi rendition="#italic">text not declassified</hi>]</p>
                <pb facs="d496-2" n="2" type="facsimile" xml:id="d496-2"/>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Note: Advance copy to Mr. Waddell (FE) 11 a.m. 2/21/CWO–JRL.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
